        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda fuga Israeli nineekiit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu gicha ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heedeanyu ak gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, eeshiina fuga ng'eanyiida Israeli gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Ghamneawa huuydeanda gil nihita huuydeanda ng'eanyiisean, ghang'eada meadajeega sean asang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa huuydeanda nihisseegwa, ak gajayiinya ng'weaninda nyarasteanyu aba badaydeang'wa. Gaydeargweakseegwa aba badayda sinaweegeagwa gaydalas uhuudeang'wa aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maydasikseegwa nea maydabwaydaneegwa, gaydalas uhuudeang'wa aba giteena sinaweegeagwa. Aba gideaba ng'asheega munyas gudugwanda bugusteang'wa, abeeda gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, “Ng'ula, gayghwahidu ng'asheanda muy, ng'asheanda muy manda gidawuurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huuydeanda nihidu, huuydeanda nih nihidu, ning'eat ghwanyasnyi ng'ula ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea fugeaba ng'eang'i, nihidu lasooda uhuudeang'wa, nihidu damanda, asaha, nineekiit damanda. Eaweeda giiluuchta gil, nea mii eaweeda nyeashta ghweelmeeda gil aba giijeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa gajayiinya durumanata nyarasteanyu aba badaydeang'wa. Gaydeargweakseegwa aba giteenna sinaweegeagwa ak gaydalas uhuudeang'wa aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maydasikseegwa nea maydabwaydaneegwa gaydalas uhuudeang'wa aba giteena sinaweegeagwa. Aba gideaba ng'asheega munyas gudugwanda bugusteang'wa, nea abeeda gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA dea las uhuudeang'wa gil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ng'ula eaweedida, ng'ula ghwahidu, nirdu habitkweadaang'u ak ea nifiirfiir bileangida nea ghang'eat ghwarjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niidiing'u geaw ng'asheega munyas, ak ghoah bileangida munyinda. Ak ea maygwanda boostaaneeda aba jeennyaawa, ghana aba jeeda fuga nyaawa, ghana gil aba jeeda baruureega nyaawa, nea manda siida jea gwandeawa mureeda aba jeenyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nihita damanda, ak ea nineekiit eaweedida, siida shaah haleanjeeda adagahoosan, nea siida shaayda adaghang'ut gurmeahiida. Aba gideaba ning'ut buuneesean nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida shaayda haleanjeeda maygabiiksa haleanjeeda sishaayda, damanda duugwandeewa aba gideaba gili siihiimuun gaba badayda buuneesean nea manda eara siyagi jea gabiigu, nea aba badaydeaba ng'asheesu munyasiin ea manda siida jea ghoaghu eaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Geeghuut durumbeati, ak geanung' ea hidaat buuneesean, ak ea manda siida weah ng'ucheeda aba gideaba nyarasteanyu gwanda badayda buuneesean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lasooda uhuuda aba badayda riing'eega fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jarooda gwanda miyeeda aba ng'uta, nea jeeda mujiini gwanda dawni ea jalooda. Gea mida madamnyeanda gajeabwar aba ng'uta, nea gea mida mujiini gayghwalas uhuuda jalooda ea geeyooda muy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gea jea gwasalda, gaygwasalda ak gaygaweay iheenga giijeega gawuurji ghariibajeega jeeda moangoachi. Nea gaba nih ayeawda aba riing'eadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygaba siisi ng'arng'ariidi geatinga, nea gang'arng'ariidi gutung'weakaaschi ea gawuurji beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gaygookwa guniyajeega, nea ghang'ut muuwda, ak saawa gaygabaspasi nea geereakgh sean iheenga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saawa gaygwajaksa lapiyeeda nyaawa jeeda naweeda bareanda bea mujiini. Ak dahaabooda nyaawa gaygawuurji gidamideawa ririnnyeanda, nea lapiyeeda nyaawa ea dahaabooda nyaawa mayghoamu ghoaghu eaweeda nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA nea maygoolang'u gurooruunatka nyaawa nea eara jeesinga nyaawa ea maygwalang'u aba gideaba abeeda heeda ng'eada ng'asheega nyaawa munyas gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwasissa geat suulga marachi gil aba dahaabu nea gwasissa geat sanaamajeega anyareesi fih ea haleanjeeda nyaawa bea baspaseega suh seaniin gaydanung' ghoah ririnnyeanda aba heeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak baruureega nyaawa gaydayiin geatinga eemoojiga suurja, ak gayghwanung' fuga munyas bea badayda ng'eanyiida ghoah easanga ak ghang'uda ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydeafuursa saawa bwadaw, ak ghang'uda ririnnyeanda gheedeanyu sibata ASEETA; ak gaygaweay jeeda fuga was mareanghooga ak ghang'uda ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina munyaloalajeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba ng'eanyiida ninyiit giidiinyeanyeeka bayiiga buuneeda, nea eara mujiini ea ninyiit ng'asheega munyas ea gabun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badaydeaba nih gaydeadu fuga eemoojiga munyas muuchi, ak gaygageanda gealga nyaawa. Nea gaydanung' goosha ghwarjeeda nyaawa raanya, nea heeda nyaawa ghaydit gajeang'uda ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas ghwahidu sawanadeeda ng'waan, abeeda gaygagasa hoyyoo ak ea mayghwanyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghwanyas habitkweeda nea mwahawda, nea goodeayi ng'asheega munyas. Ak gajeemus sibaneeda gichea eahiimu, nea ashoohoodiga ea maygwandeawa deaweedeeda was sean nea eara gweargwa ea maygwandeawa ng'asheega jea gwarukusa buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
